      "tail": 0.35,
      "min": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "lines": [
        "Back in Rome, the story goes, he dropped a fresh fig in front of the Senate. This fig, he said, grew only three days' sail from here."
      ],
      "music": "reveal",
      "sfx": [
